<%#
  The install manifest, served at /manifest.json by Rails::PwaController — see
  config/routes.rb for why that controller reaches this at all.

  Notes on the values that were a decision rather than a default:

  * start_url is the splash, and for a better reason than "it's the app's front
    door". HomeController#show checks weather_stale? and enqueues
    RefreshLocationWeatherJob, then waits on that job's broadcast — so every
    launch from the home screen is a freshness check, for free.
  * theme_color and background_color are both #103a86, icon.svg's tile blue and
    the middle stop of .wii's --panel-bg. One colour for both means the launch
    splash, the status bar and the icon are the same blue, and the handover into
    .splash's gradient reads as a continuation rather than a flash. It must stay
    in step with the layout's <meta name="theme-color">.
  * No orientation. Every Wii screen is flex + clamp() and reflows; landscape
    arguably suits a 4:3-derived design better than portrait does; and locking a
    screen someone glances at is user-hostile.
  * scope has to be "/" so the forecast's external GitHub link opens in the
    browser instead of inside the app frame — which is also what keeps the
    jukebox playing (see locations/show).
  * The maskable icon is its own file, not icon.png wearing a second purpose:
    the tile is full-bleed, so a circular mask would crop the sun's rays.
    script/build_icons.rb renders it inset into the safe zone.
  * No SVG entry. Chromium's manifest handling of SVG icons is unreliable and
    Safari uses the apple-touch-icon link instead, so PNGs are the whole story.
%>
{
  "id": "/",
  "name": "Forecast Channel",
  "short_name": "Forecast",
  "description": "The Wii Forecast Channel on the web: your local forecast panel by panel, and a globe of the world's weather.",
  "start_url": "/",
  "scope": "/",
  "display": "standalone",
  "theme_color": "#103a86",
  "background_color": "#103a86",
  "categories": [ "weather" ],
  "icons": [
    { "src": "/icon-192.png", "sizes": "192x192", "type": "image/png", "purpose": "any" },
    { "src": "/icon.png", "sizes": "512x512", "type": "image/png", "purpose": "any" },
    { "src": "/icon-maskable.png", "sizes": "512x512", "type": "image/png", "purpose": "maskable" }
  ],
  "shortcuts": [
    {
      "name": "Globe",
      "short_name": "Globe",
      "url": "/map",
      "icons": [ { "src": "/icon-192.png", "sizes": "192x192", "type": "image/png" } ]
    }
  ]
}
